Canadian investors holding rate-sensitive financials should watch for any fresh signals on the Fed's inflation framework. As today's commentary from chairwarsh highlights potential metric shifts that could reshape positioning into year end. Quick reminder, everything we discuss here is for education and entertainment. The practice investment of the day uses simulated trades with no real money. I'm not a licensed financial advisor, and this isn't financial advice.

